{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35808","headline":"哭所知 · 李咸用","name":"哭所知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝作青云士，暮爲玄夜人。\n风灯无定度，露薤亦逡巡。\n乘马惊新塚，书帷摆旧尘。\n秪应从此去，何处福生民。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}